        "created_at": "2025-07-06T13:28:30.566382+00:00",
        "notes": "This round you should either pick up  [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) or you should pick up either  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) or  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) these all depend on if you can trust your team with the damage boost from Chain Evoker or if you need more healing or range. If your dps are good and will benefit from the damage boost  [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) is a fantastic pick that will also boost your survivability. I tend to go  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) over  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) because of the extra healing for those under 50% life. \n\nThis round I also will pick up  [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391) this is an item I will keep the entire match unless I can swap it out for  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98). I don't see a lot of mercy's use  [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391) but I have started using it and as long as your are constantly using your guardian angel and angelic descent you will be healing 3% of your life per second.",
